---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = new Date('2026-05-30');
const formatted = updated.toLocaleDateString('en-US', {
  year: 'numeric',
  month: 'long',
  day: 'numeric',
});
---

<BaseLayout title="Now -- alzr.us" description="What Adam Lazarus is working on this month.">
  <h1 class="route-title" transition:name="route-now">Now</h1>
  <p class="kicker">
    A <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" rel="external">/now page</a>. What I'm actually
    working on this month. Refreshed every few weeks.
  </p>

  <ul class="now-list">
    <li>
      <strong>Day job-</strong> in the operator chair, not the founder one. Spec defense,
      holding the quality line on a product surface the team is ready to ship. The
      trade-off is the subject of <a href="/writing/founder-to-operator">the operator-mode essay</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Advisory-</strong> a multi-month DORA / Westrum / DevEx engagement recently wrapped.
      Findings useful enough to publish; the sanitized methodology post is queued for June.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Writing-</strong> first three posts shipped:
      <a href="/writing/parallel-agents-for-hiring-research">parallel Claude Code agents for hiring research</a>,
      <a href="/writing/writing-voice-guide-for-ai-assistants">the writing-voice guide for AI assistants</a>,
      and <a href="/writing/founder-to-operator">what two decades of founder/CTO work taught me about operator-mode</a>.
      Cadence target: one post a month.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Vault-</strong> extending the personal data pipeline that runs every morning at 6 AM-
      a research-narrative rollup, a deploy logger for this site, the usual cruft. Quiet work,
      paid in mornings.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Reading-</strong> agent-orchestration patterns out of Anthropic and the Claude
      Code SDK docs, plus the Karpathy autoresearch piece. Lots to steal.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p class="updated">
    Last updated: <time datetime={updated.toISOString()}>{formatted}</time>
  </p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* .kicker is a shared primitive in global.css. */
  .now-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .now-list li {
    padding: var(--list-gap) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .now-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .now-list strong {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 18, 'SOFT' 50, 'WONK' 0;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-right: var(--space-2xs);
  }

  .updated {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-eyebrow);
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
